================================================================
Third-party software
================================================================

llove depends on several third-party Python packages, each governed by its
own license (reviewable via `pip-licenses --format=markdown`). Note in
particular the OPTIONAL extras: the `[shogi]` extra pulls python-shogi
(GPL-3.0) and the `[gui]` extra pulls PySide6 (LGPLv3); both are kept behind
extras so the Apache-2.0 core wheel is unaffected unless the user opts in.
python-chess and pyqtgraph are MIT-licensed.

